        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository de2be5f7-9364-487f-bd36-990895f1b630).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. Welcome back to Haven Island.\r\rWe are looking to carry out an important mission near on the eastern beach right of the villa. But first, we must clear out a small group of vacationers and guards.\r\rDont worry 47, these people are not innocent. We found they are linked to the underground illegal data trade all over Asia.\r\rTo avoid any unwanted suspicion, make the crime look like an accident.\r\rGood Luck 47,",
